      "lineup": [
        "Wycliffe Gordon — trombone / leader",
        "Wycliffe Gordon Septet",
        "Damien Sneed & Friends — five-person chorus"
      ],
      "factual_description": "Jazz at Lincoln Center presents Wycliffe Gordon's Welcome to Georgia Town in The Appel Room on October 9-10, 2026. Friday performances are at 7:00 PM and 9:00 PM; Saturday performances are at 4:30 PM and 7:00 PM. JALC describes the work as Gordon's musical autobiography, performed by his septet with the five-person Damien Sneed & Friends chorus and centered on his life experiences and upbringing in Georgia.",
